WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.791
After a loss, do you ever feel...

00:00:01.791 --> 00:00:02.708
invisible?

00:00:02.708 --> 00:00:03.333
No

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.875
mostly because people are always

00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:06.125
extremely mean to me

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:07.000
I was like yo

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.208
I’ll never grab that ring

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:08.708
but my God

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.750
have you seen my STATS?

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.041
Whoa, pros only

00:00:11.041 --> 00:00:11.916
Remember...

00:00:11.916 --> 00:00:12.791
the Titans?

00:00:12.791 --> 00:00:14.583
Oh yeah…that’s right, the Titans

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:15.500
I forgot about them

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:16.416
We lost to the Bills

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.000
and nobody knows we exist

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.416
Yeah, we should be household names

00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:20.375
right Corey Davis?

00:00:20.375 --> 00:00:21.375
Correct, Derrick Henry

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:23.000
We need a makeover for the

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.791
Gridiron Heights homecoming dance

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.333
I heard you’re looking for a culture change

00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:28.041
Well, I used to play linebacker

00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:29.333
WHOAAAA. SO RELATABLE.

00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:33.083
First, we’re gonna touch you guys up

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:34.666
with some underperforming Patriots

00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:36.541
Next, we’ll give you a whole new look

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:38.458
Wow! Two-tone gray sleeves!

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:39.041
Lastly…

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:40.333
it’s all in the attitude

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:40.750
Here

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.625
We go for it on 4th down now

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:44.166
So we’re basically the same team-

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:46.416
-That fired our coach after winning a playoff game

00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:48.000
-And made slight roster changes

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.166
We’re beautiful!

00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:50.291
Where are the Titans?

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:52.375
I need them to beat me one more time this year

00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:53.375
Hi…

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.750
Look at those unis

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:55.166
Whoa

00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:56.708
that’s a true big-market team

00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:58.125
if I’ve ever seen one

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:00.000
Wow, the Rams got hot over the summer

